    "text": "Who are the Clay County area high school alumni in action on Thursday, Aug. 13?\nBy\nD. T. MyersThese former Clay County area high school athletes are set to compete on Thursday, Aug. 13.\nCarter Rustad\nAkron RubberDucks\nPitcher\n6′4″ 194\nStaley High School\nHometown: Fort Riley\nNext Game: vs. Altoona Curve, Thursday, Aug. 13, 6 p.m.\nTrey Snyder\nSt. Lucie Mets\nInfielder\n6′1″ 197\nLiberty North High School\nHometown: Kansas City\nNext Game: vs. Jupiter Hammerheads, Thursday, Aug. 13, 6:30 p.m.",
